to Hadley was the woman that started Women in Analytics, which is now called Data Analytics

00:22:20.760 --> 00:22:25.000
Conference, actually had one specific purpose, which was to give women.

00:22:25.719 --> 00:22:27.880
It's still a women only speaker conference.

